      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "设 $g(x)=x^3\\sin(1/x)$（$x\\ne0$），$g(0)=0$。判断 $g$ 在 $x=0$ 处是否连续，并求 $g'(0)$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "连续性判定",
        "导数定义"
      ],
      "question_type": "类似结构函数的连续性与导数计算",
      "method": [
        "夹逼定理",
        "差商极限定义"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "用 $|g(x)|\\le x^3$（对小 $x$）证明连续",
        "计算差商极限求 $g'(0)$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "oscillatory_function_derivative_basic",
        "template": "计算形如x^n sin(1/x)型函数在0处的连续性与导数",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$|g(x)|=|x|^3|\\sin(1/x)|\\le|x|^3\\to0$，故 $g$ 在0处连续",
            "$g'(0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\dfrac{h^3\\sin(1/h)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}h^2\\sin(1/h)=0$（夹逼定理）",
            "所以 $g'(0)=0$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-fc465515e5-q03-practice-02",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "对 $x\\ne0$ 求 $g(x)=x^3\\sin(1/x)$ 的导函数 $g'(x)$，并讨论 $g'(x)$ 在 $x\\to0$ 时是否有极限。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "求导法则",
        "极限存在性分析"
      ],
      "question_type": "导函数极限存在性判定",
      "method": [
        "乘积求导法则",
        "极限分解分析"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "用乘积法则求 $g'(x)$",
        "分析各项在 $x\\to0$ 时的极限"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "derivative_limit_analysis",
        "template": "求x^n sin(1/x)型函数导函数并判断x→0处极限是否存在",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$g'(x)=3x^2\\sin(1/x)+x^3\\cos(1/x)\\cdot(-1/x^2)=3x^2\\sin(1/x)-x\\cos(1/x)$",
            "当 $x\\to0$ 时，$3x^2\\sin(1/x)\\to0$（夹逼），$x\\cos(1/x)\\to0$（夹逼，因 $|\\cos(1/x)|\\le1$）",
            "两项均趋于0，故 $\\lim_{x\\to0}g'(x)=0$，与 $g'(0)=0$ 一致，说明此时 $g'$ 在0处连续（与原题 $f$ 不同，因指数更高）"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-fc465515e5-q03-practice-03",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "判断函数 $h(x)=x\\sin(1/x)$（$x\\ne0$），$h(0)=0$ 在 $x=0$ 处是否连续，是否可微。",
      "knowledge_points": [
